{"unit_id":"Areium__dsh-fail-logger#card-zh","repo":"Areium/dsh-fail-logger","commit":"bce6c992d67485475caeed00b8997704b3657d93","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-fail-logger 是 DeepSeek Harness 插件，监听会话事件并记录原生工具、PTC run_code 与代码内工具调用的失败。它按错因归并、计数和排序，将实录写入本地技能文件与状态账本，并可把预防规则和高频错误加入系统提示，适合希望减少重复工具错误的 DSH 用户。默认无需账号或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:99-112","lib/index.js:534-607"]}
{"unit_id":"Areium__dsh-fail-logger#card-en","repo":"Areium/dsh-fail-logger","commit":"bce6c992d67485475caeed00b8997704b3657d93","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-fail-logger is a DeepSeek Harness plugin that records native tool, PTC run_code, and nested tool failures. It groups recurring causes, counts and ranks them, saves a local skill log, and can add prevention guidance to the system prompt. It helps DSH users avoid repeating common errors.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:99-112","lib/index.js:534-607"]}
